# Building a General-Purpose AI Chatbot
## Development Plan — Beginner Guide

---

## What You Are Building

A ChatGPT-style AI assistant that:
- Answers any question in natural language
- Remembers the conversation history (context-aware)
- Works on a website (desktop + mobile browser)
- Can be extended into a native mobile app (Phase 2)

---

## How It Works (The Big Picture)

```
User types a message
        │
        ▼
  Web Browser (Frontend)
  HTML + CSS + JavaScript
        │  sends message via HTTPS
        ▼
  Your Backend Server (Node.js)
  Keeps your API key SECRET
        │  forwards to OpenAI
        ▼
  OpenAI API (GPT-4o)
  The actual AI brain
        │  returns AI reply
        ▼
  Backend → Frontend → Displayed to user
```

You NEVER put your API key in the frontend (browser).
Anyone can see browser code. The backend is your security layer.

---

## Tech Stack (Chosen for Beginners)

| Layer | Technology | Why |
|-------|-----------|-----|
| Frontend | HTML + CSS + Vanilla JS | No setup needed, runs in any browser |
| Backend | Node.js + Express | Simple, widely documented, beginner-friendly |
| AI Engine | OpenAI GPT-4o API | Most capable, same as ChatGPT |
| Mobile (Phase 2) | React Native / PWA | Build once, run on iOS + Android |
| Hosting | Render.com (free tier) | Free backend hosting, no credit card |

