## Step-by-Step Setup (After Files Are Created)

### Step 1 — Get Your OpenAI API Key
1. Go to https://platform.openai.com/signup
2. Create a free account
3. Go to API Keys → Create new secret key
4. Copy it — you only see it once!

### Step 2 — Install Node.js
1. Go to https://nodejs.org
2. Download the LTS version (green button)
3. Install it (next, next, finish)
4. Open PowerShell and type: `node --version`
   You should see something like: `v20.x.x`

### Step 3 — Run the Backend
```powershell
# Navigate to the backend folder
cd "C:\Users\Administrator\Desktop\ai-chatbot\backend"

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Add your API key to the .env file
# Open .env and replace YOUR_KEY_HERE with your actual key

# Start the server
node server.js
# You should see: "Server running on http://localhost:3000"
```

### Step 4 — Open the Frontend
Open `frontend/index.html` in your browser.
Type a message. The AI should respond!

