## What "API Key" Means

An API key is like a password that:
- Proves to OpenAI that requests come from YOUR account
- Gets billed to YOUR account
- Must be kept secret (treat it like a bank PIN)

RULE: Never paste your API key in HTML, JavaScript, or any file you'll share/upload.
It always lives in the .env file on your backend server only.
